      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in a \"future\" when the present is this painful. it's like i'm trapped in a room where every exit is locked, and every time i try to breathe, it just hurts more. i don't see how things get better, i just see how much more time i have to spend feeling like this. sometimes i just wish i could find a way to make the noise stop for good. it would be so much easier to just... stop existing than to keep fighting for a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore.",
